Package: scExploreR
Title: Single-Cell RNA-Seq Explorer with UMAP Visualization
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Leya", "Alexander",
           email = "leyaalexander@usf.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An educational toolkit for exploring single-cell RNA
    sequencing (scRNA-seq) data. Provides easy-to-use functions for UMAP
    visualization, descriptive statistics, and hypothesis testing (t-tests,
    ANOVA) of gene expression data. Demonstrates three R plotting systems
    (Base Graphics, Lattice, and ggplot2) using a bundled PBMC dataset.
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: 
    ggplot2,
    lattice,
    stats,
    grDevices,
    graphics
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
License: CC0
LazyData: true
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
URL: https://github.com/LeyaAlexander/r-programming-assignments
